---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, question, subject, trunc(_score, 2) as _score FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', answer) order by _score desc, id LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |   Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).answer, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).question, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).subject, trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score, Int64(2)) AS _score     |
|               |     TableScan: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer) projection=[id, question, answer, subject, _score]                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| physical_plan | SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@4 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@2 as answer, question@1 as question, subject@3 as subject, trunc(_score@4, 2) as _score]                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=1000), expr=[_score@4 DESC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |       ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, question@1 as question, answer@2 as answer, subject@3 as subject, 1 - cosine_distance(CAST(query_vector() AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true })), CAST(answer_embedding@4 AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true }))) as _score] |
|               |         SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |           BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[2]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
